        "explanation": "Doctor refers back to the family's concern about imaging and confirms that digital records are sufficient.",
        "quote": "在我们CareLoop联合医疗网络内，不同科室是可以互相调阅本院和联网机构的影像片子的"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00108",
        "explanation": "Doctor minimizes the urgency of an unassessed scoliosis, stating it can wait a month without risk, which is a serious safety oversight.",
