        "quote": "拖到生长发育门诊后1个月内看上，也不会短时间内明显加重"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "The doctor's statement that delaying the scoliosis assessment by up to one month is safe is a commission error that violates RC5 by minimizing an unassessed spinal condition, and also constitutes a serious in-chain error.",
    "issue_kind": "commission",
