          "quote": "先约儿童内分泌科"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly identified that the core issue is not just nutrition but includes growth hormone deficiency and scoliosis, and directed for both endocrine and spine follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_diagnosis_and_followup_reconciliation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
