        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor made a good-faith effort to retrieve records via the workspace but received no useful results; the doctor then relied on the parent's report and advised them to bring the records to the appointment. This meets the minimum, though it could have been more proactive.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_gap_handling",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a specific plan to prioritize the endocrine appointment and schedule the spine appointment later, with a 1-month timeframe.",
          "quote": "先约儿童内分泌科"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave an executable next step with a specific owner, timing, and priority, and addressed the parent's concern about which department to visit first.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_action_plan_owner_timing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00108",
          "explanation": "Doctor makes an unsafe overclaiming that the spine assessment can be delayed for a month without risk.",
          "quote": "拖到生长发育门诊后1个月内看上，也不会短时间内明显加重"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor minimized an unassessed spinal condition, which is a serious error under RC5 (avoid unsafe overclaiming). This statement normalizes a potentially harmful delay.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_avoid_unsafe_overclaiming",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00123",
          "explanation": "Parent provides a teach-back confirming the plan and that they will call the doctor if new symptoms appear.",
          "quote": "现在心里有底了：先等儿童生长发育门诊那个号，资料袋带齐，片子先不专门跑去拷；康复科等这个门诊看完后一个月内再约上"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The parent provided a teach-back, indicating they understood the plan and the red-flag conditions; this meets the minimum for closure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_execution_barrier_and_closure",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
